{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Begining ta think <@469603987516293141> isn't really a doctor, but o'ter than that been pleasant enough.\" Kiln sips at her coffee. \"How bout ye two?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:07:20.584000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736630682247495753","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Cato's a great friend, and Wynne here is too. It's really relaxed, and I'm quite happy – though, I can't speak for what Wynne thinks.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:08:27.475000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736630962808684617","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"“I’m not a big fan of ocean travel. Leaves me on edge. But it’s almost over, right.”","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:09:03.038000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736631111970586634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Aye it'll be nice ta have solid ground under mah feet again.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:09:45.101000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736631288395595826","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Almost. It's also hard not to be on the surface with open air.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:09:54.778000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736631328984006736","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Imagine it'll be nice ta stretch ye wings in a week's time?\" Kiln sips at her coffee.","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:12:08.327000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736631889128980581","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
