{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"labotep","id":"346493235948158977","is_bot":0,"username":"nyarlathotepcc"},"author_id":"346493235948158977","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"Traxim went to the mess hall for sustenance. To this end, he picked a variety of foods and placed them on his tray. After taking his seat, he slowly ate. Most of his focus was on making sketches on a napkin.","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:34:11.123000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736637437337534594","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Jus what I learned o'er tha last 15 years. Spent some hermitage in the deserts o Afrika wit tha Brunelocks. Coin wasn't a concept ta them.\" Kiln fiddles with her talisman.","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:35:59.186000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736637890586476605","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"You strike me as very wise.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:36:29.949000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638019616112670","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Ha! Thas a first!\" Kiln chuckles to her self.","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:37:21.191000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638234540638220","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"We traded a lot with the folks south of the mediterranean, seemed like nice enough people, and wiser than the sands of Arabia\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:37:40.113000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638313905258597","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Brother Traxim, got yer nose stuck in a tha clouds again? Come back ta Terra an sit wit us!\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:38:48.023000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638598740312176","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Good to see you, Traxim!\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:39:08.981000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638686644666518","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"They were a lot kinder than tha crown would have ye believe.\" Kiln sips her bitter coffee.","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:39:54.479000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736638877477109810","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"izar","id":"566079740591603714","is_bot":0,"username":"izarsystem"},"author_id":"566079740591603714","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"I'm from Florence. I was born closer to Afrika than I was to some places in Britain. If those who had a different colour of skin in the human race were really \"malevolent\", then what the hells am I?\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:41:48.527000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736639355828961382","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"justjack420","id":"592252026226999306","is_bot":0,"username":"justjack420"},"author_id":"592252026226999306","channel_id":"636019040174997505","content":"\"Ha, a Daemon of some sorts I imagine. Ye seem jus as kind as any o tha Brunelocks.\"","created_at":"2020-07-25T17:43:08.519000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"736639691339857992","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
